				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.2.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sight</i> (i. e. <i>thing seen</i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν βλέψιν ἀναφλεχθείς</span>”
